## 3. Step-by-Step Nursing Workflow

| Step | Stage | What Happens | Main Role |
| ---- | ----- | ------------ | --------- |
| 1 | OPD vitals (when applicable) | Triage vitals on OPD encounter before or during consultation. | Nurse |
| 2 | IPD handover receive | Accept handover from admission desk, OPD, emergency, or another ward. | Ward nurse |
| 3 | Admission checklist | Identity, baseline vitals, allergies, belongings, care plan, notify doctor. | Ward nurse |
| 4 | Ward care loop | Vitals, nursing notes, MAR, nursing-task orders, observations. | Ward nurse |
| 5 | Doctor coordination | Surface pending meds, alerts, vitals trend for ward round context. | Ward nurse / Doctor |
| 6 | Transfer / escalation | Progress transfer; ICU escalation hands off to ICU module (do not start ICU stay here). | Charge nurse / Doctor |
| 7 | Post-op / step-down receive | Accept handover from Theater or ICU with summary when API provides. | Ward nurse |
| 8 | Discharge nursing clearance | Patient education, ward checklist â" [discharge-flow Â§4](./discharge-flow.mdc). | Ward nurse |

