## 4. Backend Queue Contract

Nursing board loads via `GET /ipd-flows?include_icu=true` with ward and scope filters.

| Scope / filter | User meaning |
| -------------- | ------------ |
| Ward filter | Patients in selected ward |
| `ADMITTED_IN_BED` | Active ward patients |
| Medication due / handover pending | Client or backend scope when supported |
| `In ICU` badge | Patient in ICU â" link to ICU workspace for ICU mutations |
| Exclude `DISCHARGED` / `CANCELLED` | Active queues only |

Mutations prefer `POST /ipd-flows/:id/*` (`add-nursing-note`, `add-medication-administration`, `add-ward-round`, `request-transfer`, `plan-discharge`).

